 "code": "def remove_duplicates(nums: list[int]) -> list:\n    if not nums:\n        return [0, []]\n    write = 1                                   # nums[0] is always kept\n    for read in range(1, len(nums)):\n        if nums[read] != nums[write - 1]:\n            nums[write] = nums[read]\n            write += 1\n    return [write, nums[:write]]\n",
